Zero point energy                ...      0.15344687 Eh      96.29 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00938201 Eh       5.89 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
